# Windows-consumed scripts must materialize with CRLF endings on
# checkout: cmd.exe's batch parser mis-splits lines in LF-only files
# (it "works" until a byte-offset shift makes it eat characters —
# which broke windeploy.bat once already). eol=crlf makes every
# checkout CRLF regardless of core.autocrlf, on every platform.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
